      <p begin="00:01.630" end="00:03.240" ttm:agent="v1">Imma baddie baddie baddie</p>
      <p begin="00:03.240" end="00:04.840" ttm:agent="v1">Pretty little risky baddie</p>
      <p begin="00:04.840" end="00:08.100" ttm:agent="v1">뭐든 될 대로 되라지 Catch me if you can</p>
      <p begin="00:08.100" end="00:09.600" ttm:agent="v1">Baddie baddie baddie</p>
      <p begin="00:09.490" end="00:11.200" ttm:agent="v1">나는 없어 거기 이미</p>
      <p begin="00:11.200" end="00:15.360" ttm:agent="v1">어차피 못 찾을 테니 Catch me if you can</p>
      <p begin="00:15.360" end="00:17.970" ttm:agent="v1">Nothing like the regulars</p>
      <p begin="00:17.970" end="00:21.030" ttm:agent="v1">내 DNA엔 blue blood runs</p>
      <p begin="00:21.030" end="00:26.040" ttm:agent="v1">더 솔직하게 말해줘 착한 척은 지겨워</p>
      <p begin="00:26.040" end="00:27.540" ttm:agent="v1">우리 앞에선 룰이</p>
      <p begin="00:27.150" end="00:28.930" ttm:agent="v1">의미 없었어 굳이</p>
      <p begin="00:28.930" end="00:31.780" ttm:agent="v1">유행이 돌고 돌아도 난 그 틀에 없어 이미</p>
      <p begin="00:31.780" end="00:33.280" ttm:agent="v1">I wanna break I wanna kick</p>
      <p begin="00:32.980" end="00:34.800" ttm:agent="v1">뛰어 놀래 시끄럽게</p>
      <p begin="00:34.800" end="00:37.750" ttm:agent="v1">다채로운 매력 수많은 변칙 위에 더 빛을 발하지</p>
      <p begin="00:37.750" end="00:43.400" ttm:agent="v1">답답한 건 벗어 던져</p>
      <p begin="00:43.400" end="00:49.170" ttm:agent="v1">고개 숙일 필요 없어</p>
